<view class="page page-safe">
  <view class="eyebrow">EXPORT</view>
  <view class="title">导出报表</view>
  <view class="muted">完整支出、问题与合同明细，导出为 CSV。看一次激励视频后由服务端签发解锁凭证。</view>

  <view class="lock-card" wx:if="{{!unlocked}}">
    <view class="lock-icon">▤</view>
    <view class="title-sm">完整数据待解锁</view>
    <view class="lock-copy">广告只出现在这里和页面底部；记账、进度、合同操作不受影响。</view>
    <view class="ad-preview" wx:if="{{adReward.show}}">
      <view class="ad-tag">激励视频 · {{adReward.name}}</view>
      <view class="ad-copy">{{adReward.copy || '观看完整视频后解锁'}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="ad-preview" wx:else>
      <view class="ad-tag">激励视频未启用</view>
      <view class="ad-copy">管理端未配置导出页激励视频，暂时无法解锁。</view>
    </view>
    <button class="btn btn-block" bindtap="watchAd" loading="{{loading}}">看视频解锁导出</button>
    <view class="tiny lock-note">服务端会校验解锁 token；直接调用导出接口会被拒绝。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="unlocked-card" wx:else>
    <view class="row between">
      <view>
        <view class="tiny">已解锁</view>
        <view class="title-sm">CSV 报表</view>
      </view>
      <view class="pill pill-green">可导出</view>
    </view>
    <view class="preview-box">
      <view class="preview-line" wx:for="{{preview}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view>
    </view>
    <view class="export-actions">
      <button class="btn btn-soft flex1" bindtap="copyCsv">复制 CSV</button>
      <button class="btn flex1" bindtap="saveCsv">保存文件</button>
    </view>
    <view class="tiny lock-note">导出只包含当前账号的数据；服务端按用户隔离。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="ad-slot" wx:if="{{adFeed.show}}" bindtap="tapFeed">
    <view class="ad-tag">广告 · {{adFeed.name}}</view>
    <view class="ad-copy">{{adFeed.copy}}</view>
    <view class="ad-arrow">›</view>
  </view>
</view>
